    "abstract": "Ru M3-edge resonant inelastic x-ray scattering (RIXS) measurements of α -RuCl3 with 27 meV resolution reveals a spin-orbit exciton without noticeable splitting. We extract values for the spin-orbit coupling constant ( λ = 154 ± 2 meV) and trigonal distortion field energy (| ∆ | < 65 meV) which support the j eff = 1 / 2 nature of α -RuCl3. We demonstrate the feasibility of M- edge RIXS for 4 d systems, which allows ultra high-resolution RIXS of 4 d systems until instrumentation for L-edge RIXS improves.",
    "keywords": [
      "Kitaev quantum spin liquid",
